<title>FRANCE: France may approve Havas/Gle des Eaux bid for SFP.</title>
<headline>France may approve Havas/Gle des Eaux bid for SFP.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French finance ministry is set to approve a joint bid by French media giant Havas and utility Compagnie Generale des Eaux for film production company SFP, daily Les Echos reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The two companies announced in October they were bidding for SFP, which is being privatised.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
